==============================================================================
held-out: does the fitted resonance beat the declared one on unseen people?
==============================================================================
both sides profile the drive exponent and the overall scale identically, so the only
difference scored is where the resonance sits and how sharp it is.  the likelihood is
the exact gamma density of an averaged periodogram, so a night with more surviving
windows carries more weight by construction rather than by a chosen weight.

